        "node_id": "n_1_2534f0",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1: Instead of using eval() which can be dangerous and prone to syntax errors, implement a custom expression evaluator that handles the arithmetic operations directly. This approach will be more robust and avoid the syntax error issues encountered with eval().",
