        "node_id": "n_2_861ab8",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the previous implementation was that it didn't consider all possible ways to add brackets, particularly when there are multiple multiplication operations. Let's refine our approach to consider all possible bracket placements, including those that don't necessarily start at the beginning of the expression. This will help us find the optimal solution for expressions with multiple multiplication operations.",
